    "title": "Omega x Swatch MoonSwatch İncelemesi: Tüm Modeller Bir Bakışta",
    "category": "Omega & Koleksiyon",
    "publish_date": "3 Ağustos 2026",
    "raw_date": "2026-08-03",
    "author": "Belgin Saat & Mücevherat Editoryal Kurulu",
    "read_time": "14 dk okuma",
    "image": "images/magazine/moonswatch-review-all-models-at-a-glance.jpg",
    "summary": "MoonSwatch Review – All Models at a Glance (Image: Swatch)",
    "content_html": "<p class=\"mag-lead-para\">MoonSwatch Review – All Models at a Glance (Image: Swatch)</p> <h2 class=\"mag-subheading\">Tarihsel Kökenler ve Mekanik Mükemmellik</h2> <p>It’s now been over four years ago since the first MoonSwatch models were launched. Accompanied by much skepticism – sometimes malice – and lengthy queues in front of the points of sale, the MoonSwatch has definitely secured its place in the watch world. In order to maintain the success of the series, Swatch has made every effort to revise and renew the models since their debut. Now, yet another new version of this much-debated model has been released—the most exclusive one to date—prompting us to take a closer look at the new version and provide an overview of the entire lineup. In this article, we’re taking a closer look at the development of the successful model series.</p> <p>The latest—and arguably most exclusive—addition to the MoonSwatch collection is the Mission to the Moon 1969, unveiled in July 2026 to commemorate the Apollo 11 Moon landing. Limited to just 1,969 individually numbered pieces, it is the rarest standard MoonSwatch ever produced. Unlike previous Moonshine Gold editions that featured only a gold seconds hand, this model incorporates 11 grams of Omega’s 18K Moonshine™ Gold across the kadran, hands, crown, and pushers. Even more remarkably, the gold was created by melting down vintage Omega components dating back to the era of the Moon landing. Additional tributes include a special Apollo 11 caseback, a black-and-gold color scheme inspired by the Speedmaster, and an unconventional allocation process that required prospective buyers to complete Swatch’s “Electronic Swatch saat Application” (ESTA). With its historical significance, precious-metal content, and extremely limited production, the Mission to the Moon 1969 stands as the most ambitious and collectible MoonSwatch released to date.</p> <div class=\"mag-quote-box\"><blockquote>“Speedmaster ve Seamaster efsaneleri, insanın sınırları aşma arzusunu mekanik bir başyapıta dönüştüren yaşayan bir mirastır.”</blockquote></div> <h2 class=\"mag-subheading\">İkincil Piyasa Dinamikleri ve Değerleme Analizi</h2> <p>The idea behind the collaboration between Swatch and Omega sounds pretty great: The brands wanted to make the visual role model of the MoonSwatch, the popular Omega Speedmaster Professional Moonwatch, accessible to a wider audience by making it more affordable for the masses. It was a very clever move, because Omega also attracted the attention of a younger target group with this model series, who may not yet be among the buyers of higher-priced models, but could be the watch enthusiasts of tomorrow with higher purchasing power. The foundation for the success of the MoonSwatch was laid by the first 11 models in primarily bright colors. They are (nearly) perfect fashion pieces that can be combined in a variety of ways.</p> <p>Bir bakışta MoonSwatch'ın ilk 11 modelinin tümü (fotoğraflar: Swatch).</p> <p>The different variants represent the planets in our solar system, including the Sun and Moon. Although the International Astronomical Union (IAU) no longer classifies Pluto as a planet, they’ve been generous enough to give the dwarf planet its own model.</p> <h3 class=\"mag-subheading-h3\">Koleksiyon Değeri ve Alıcı Rehberi</h3> <p>Görünüm açısından Swatch X Omega MoonSwatch, efsanevi orijinaline olağanüstü derecede sadık kalıyor. Asimetrik kasa ve belirgin takimetre çerçevesi (çerçeve) gibi tasarım özellikleri göz ardı edilemez; ayırt edici kurma kolu ve kronograf butonları bile orijinal Speedmaster Moonwatch ile aynıdır. 42 mm'lik çap ve 47,2 mm'lik çıkıntıdan çıkıntıya uzunluk da orijinal Omega'dan alınmıştır. Kalınlık, prototipin Hesalite versiyonuyla neredeyse aynı. Oldukça sade tasarlanmış kasa arkası küçük ama düşünceli bir ayrıntı sunuyor: Pil kapağında, ilgili MoonSwatch modellerinin temsil ettiği gök cisminin oldukça gerçekçi bir kopyası yer alıyor. Kalite açısından - ve bu, her alıcı için yalnızca fiyattan anlaşılmalıdır - Swatch X Omega MoonSwatch'ın orijinaliyle hiçbir ortak yanı yoktur. Kronograf butonlarının genel hissiyatı gayet iyi olsa da saati ayarlamak oldukça zor. Aydınlık malzeme tatmin edici bir iş çıkarıyor. Kasa malzemesi hoş bir sürpriz çünkü Swatch'a özel seramik ve biyoplastik karışımı sanıldığından daha ilham verici. Saat gerçekten iyi hissettiriyor ancak bileğinde biraz ağırlık hissetmek isteyenler hayal kırıklığına uğrayacaktır: TheMoonSwatch yalnızca 29 gram ağırlığında olup, özellikle çelik muadiliyle karşılaştırıldığında son derece hafiftir. Bununla birlikte, Velcro kayış başarılıdır ve çok fazla uzay cazibesi yaymaktadır.</p> <p>A year after the release of the first 11 models of the MoonSwatch, the group decided to launch a new model every month with the title “Mission to Moonshine Gold.” The base for almost all of these models was the Mission to the Moon, with the exception of the August edition. The only thing that changed was the second hand, which was to be dedicated to a different theme each month.</p> <p>Fark ayrıntılarda gizlidir: Mission to Moonshine Gold (fotoğraflar: Swatch).</p> <p>The Mission to Neptune was used as the basis for the August edition. This is the only model in the second edition that clearly stands out and is therefore still one of the En Popüler models in this series today. Although the Mission to Moonshine Gold variants are not very imaginative, the fact that the Moonshine Gold second hands were produced exclusively under a full moon gives you an interesting conversation starter.</p> <p class=\"mag-seo-internal-box\" style=\"margin-top: 2rem; padding: 1.25rem; background: rgba(5,51,47,0.05); border-left: 4px solid var(--color-teal); border-radius: 4px;\"><strong>Belgin Saat Koleksiyonu:</strong> Aradığınız ikonik referansları ve nadir modelleri incelemek için <a href=\"/elit-kategori/\" style=\"color: var(--color-teal); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;\">Elit Saat Koleksiyonumuzu</a> veya tüm seçkin <a href=\"/saatler/\" style=\"color: var(--color-teal); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;\">Lüks Saat Modellerimizi</a> ziyaret edebilir, İzmir Buca showroomumuzda uzman ekibimizden özel ekspertiz randevusu alabilirsiniz.</p>",
    "source_url": "https://www.chrono24.com/magazine/repub-moonswatch-review-all-models-at-a-glance-p_101475/"
